WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.214 --> 00:00:03.197
- Welcome everyone to the main event panel

00:00:03.197 --> 00:00:04.491
featuring the three hottest writers

00:00:04.491 --> 00:00:06.898
in the fantasy sci-fi biz.

00:00:06.898 --> 00:00:08.017
Let's hear it for 'em.

00:00:08.017 --> 00:00:10.600
(crowd cheers)

00:00:13.964 --> 00:00:16.273
(bird caw cheering)

00:00:16.273 --> 00:00:17.106
Do you mind sir?

00:00:17.106 --> 00:00:18.141
Thank you.

00:00:18.141 --> 00:00:20.755
Okay first question, what new
characters are you working on?

00:00:20.755 --> 00:00:24.507
We'll start with you Greg R.
R. H. L. L. L. Q. T. Harkin.

00:00:24.507 --> 00:00:27.543
- She is an exquisitely
beautiful ballerina

00:00:27.543 --> 00:00:29.823
and a deadly assassin.

00:00:29.823 --> 00:00:31.625
It's Vendetta Veets.

00:00:31.625 --> 00:00:33.435
(crowd cheers)

00:00:33.435 --> 00:00:36.187
- Well how bout you Kim
Ber Lee of Vernel Comics.

00:00:36.187 --> 00:00:40.385
- Falcon Man is finally
getting a sidekick.

00:00:40.385 --> 00:00:42.132
Falcon Boy.

00:00:42.132 --> 00:00:44.678
(crowd cheers)

00:00:44.678 --> 00:00:48.172
(victorious music)

00:00:48.172 --> 00:00:50.284
- But if there's anyone
that's gonna top it

00:00:50.284 --> 00:00:53.689
it is the comic book genius
himself, John Queebon.

00:00:53.689 --> 00:00:54.522
John.

00:00:54.522 --> 00:00:55.640
- Yeah, what?

00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:58.204
- What new characters are you working on?

00:00:58.204 --> 00:01:00.209
- So many to choose from.

00:01:00.209 --> 00:01:01.708
- Tell us 'em all, yes.

00:01:01.708 --> 00:01:02.863
(clapping)

00:01:02.863 --> 00:01:04.915
- Doctor Detangler.

00:01:04.915 --> 00:01:07.774
He's really good at detangling earbuds.

00:01:07.774 --> 00:01:08.758
(crowd claps weakly)

00:01:08.758 --> 00:01:09.591
- [Host] Kay, okay nice.

00:01:09.591 --> 00:01:11.081
- [Host] Kay, okay nice.

00:01:11.081 --> 00:01:14.002
- Or there's the human paper shredder.

00:01:14.002 --> 00:01:18.169
He eats paper and then a few
hours later he expels it.

00:01:19.222 --> 00:01:22.352
Not to mention the Garbage Bag Guru.

00:01:22.352 --> 00:01:24.021
When he gets a new garbage bag, he always

00:01:24.021 --> 00:01:24.854
knows exactly which side has the opening.

00:01:24.854 --> 00:01:28.271
knows exactly which side has the opening.

00:01:29.548 --> 00:01:32.555
Right, you know cause like
it has the little the thing.

00:01:32.555 --> 00:01:33.388
(knocks glass over)

00:01:33.388 --> 00:01:34.221
